    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n106145" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑά̆λ-ῐνος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of crystal</i> or <i>glass,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Corinn.
				42
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκπώματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ach.</u>
					74
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφραγίς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					22.1451.13
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκεύη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Mort.</u>
					39
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιάλαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					1106.153
				</span></i>
			 (Cos. <span class="entity">iv/iii B. C.</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				16
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				<u>PPetr.</u>
				3p.113
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				2.27.3
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. χρῶμα,</span>
			=
			<i>ferrugineus, Gloss.; hyalinum</i> is expld. as <i>vitreum,
				viridi colore,</i> ib.: also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑέλινος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				14.52
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>VH</u>
				13.3
			</span></i>. [On the quantity, 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕαλος</span>
			 fin.]</div>
